_url":"https://github.com/jif-oai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"3cf6f08da562ee1bf6866fbc2db45a3c3af620ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/3cf6f08da562ee1bf6866fbc2db45a3c3af620ff","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/3cf6f08da562ee1bf6866fbc2db45a3c3af620ff"}]},{"sha":"3cf6f08da562ee1bf6866fbc2db45a3c3af620ff","node_id":"C_kwDOOYsS4doAKDNjZjZmMDhkYTU2MmVlMWJmNjg2NmZiYzJkYjQ1YTNjM2FmNjIwZmY","commit":{"author":{"name":"jif-oai","email":"jif@openai.com","date":"2026-06-02T12:35:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-02T12:35:26Z"},"message":"session: keep startup prewarm aligned with resolved multi-agent runtime (#25841)\n\n## Why\n\nFollow-up to #25722. Startup prewarm builds a preview `TurnContext`\nbefore the first real turn so it can precompute the initial prompt and\ntool surface. After the per-thread runtime work landed, that preview\npath still recomputed multi-agent mode from `model_info` and feature\ndefaults instead of reusing the runtime the session had already resolved\nfrom persisted metadata or inheritance.\n\nThat could leave the prewarmed session primed for a different\nmulti-agent mode than the first real turn, which is especially risky\nbecause collaboration tool exposure depends on\n`turn_context.multi_agent_version`.\n\n## What changed\n\n- In the `TurnMultiAgentRuntime::Preview` path, prefer\n`Session::multi_agent_version()` when it is already known.\n- Only fall back to `model_info.multi_agent_version` and feature\ndefaults when the session has not resolved a runtime yet.\n- Keep preview mode read-only: this still avoids storing a runtime\nduring startup prewarm.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Not run (small runtime-selection follow-up)","tree":{"sha":"1a1ee5f23b706b88b0b687fe526945df36b02203","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/1a1ee5f23b706b88b0b687fe526945df36b02203"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/3cf6f08da562ee1bf6866fbc2db45a3c3af620ff","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHs4OCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3xwQAIOqj3HWMKi1RsyEQ4G/anVj\niK0fDKxZTzhTAH4zYQAP4c3LyoNSjSshqx4GYifOnx0LFIYX72pmT3YAyRZzsD1g\n2ZMPnTWtAfIymyCjxFQgFo4OwuHvvMwwtfSHM8vwo1NJi3Q8T99pAHIEo5bkdHJn\ncX9bqEi4O5o19hGOYHDjv6H/JnPCcfMV7prsQIf5P30u5Cy5sCJnCkPQFt85DB7V\ne4DqwA/irEBYkceHsdHWd2t0s8ax4JYZyRxjcPMO5oAvnhjdHK5yfyS0JtE3ST0t\nuj/8hz9NQJBU3+9PhkvINPMH4V/pl/QiYRrPjunJmGxrN5OPHketluCXyUvWIrO+\nUxXSOIFeelwL4xM5NNa63DnWuA923l2zOEXveCLVjtUDRqwYnMq8diHBMrfVm4UD\nNlWLBh031FWxw+O+jhc2u+rzxg3MeipHPe9kptXTxVxlIUkrfiHkHctXhnICSwHD\nPGG+lod3JIWCKqiaJxror7KQdD+IcEW657s4Tp38g+tDHfMdh73xJOKWtHm7/kOP\nxV2zg49AIde2vAqBRwyjvq/JWLhVneDcHXs5DlX81zr/Bd77lI6VHmLkuwZWM8bQ\n3vxVLXYsvSJ/YU0hphyaWbWRizRYIS5cbWO5zv7sRf2ApOm/gBoo129LM+lx6lMX\nwqUHZuHbin1wgrPNQCln\n=z1Dr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 1a1ee5f23b706b88b0b687fe526945df36b02203\nparent bf9fd885b2546e91fe3bab271aa481b070f47518\nauthor jif-oai <jif@openai.com> 1780403726 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780403726 +0200\n\nsession: keep startup prewarm aligned with resolved multi-agent runtime (#25841)\n\n## Why\n\nFollow-up to #25722. Startup prewarm builds a preview `TurnContext`\nbefore the first real turn so it can precompute the initial prompt and\ntool surface. After the per-thread runtime work landed, that preview\npath still recomputed multi-agent mode from `model_info` and feature\ndefaults instead of reusing the runtime the session had already resolved\nfrom persisted metadata or inheritance.\n\nThat could leave the prewarmed session primed for a different\nmulti-agent mode than the first real turn, which is especially risky\nbecause collaboration tool exposure depends on\n`turn_context.multi_agent_version`.\n\n## What changed\n\n- In the `TurnMultiAgentRuntime::Preview` path, prefer\n`Session::multi_agent_version()` when it is already known.\n- Only fall back to `model_info.multi_agent_version` and feature\ndefaults when the session has not resolved a runtime yet.\n- Keep preview mode read-only: this still avoids storing a runtime\nduring startup prewarm.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Not run (small runtime-selection follow-up)","verified_at":"2026-06-02T12:35:27Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/3cf6f08da562ee1bf6866fbc2db45a3c3af620ff","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/3cf6f08da562ee1bf6866fbc2db45a3c3af620ff","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/3cf6f08da562ee1bf6866fbc2db45a3c3af620ff/comments","author":{"login":"jif-oai","id":230027070,"node_id":"U_kgDODbXvPg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230027070?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai","html_url":"https://github.com/jif-oai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"bf9fd885b2546e91fe3bab271aa481b070f47518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/bf9fd885b2546e91fe3bab271aa481b070f47518","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/bf9fd885b2546e91fe3bab271aa481b070f47518"}]},{"sha":"bf9fd885b2546e91fe3bab271aa481b070f47518","node_id":"C_kwDOOYsS4doAKGJmOWZkODg1YjI1NDZlOTFmZTNiYWIyNzFhYTQ4MWIwNzBmNDc1MTg","commit":{"author":{"name":"jif-oai","email":"jif@openai.com","date":"2026-06-02T12:31:00Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-02T12:31:00Z"},"message":"Resolve per-thread multi-agent runtime (#25722)\n\nStack split from #25708. Original PR intentionally left open. This third\nPR resolves the effective per-thread multi-agent runtime from persisted\nmetadata, inherited runtime, and current model selection.","tree":{"sha":"c69d2e84ffa1a7bf6f551213e5e94e1846f93498","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/c69d2e84ffa1a7bf6f551213e5e94e1846f93498"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/bf9fd885b2546e91fe3bab271aa481b070f47518","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHs0ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARfwQACS/a7BvmK3bo3oREp8790SX\ngDarRmXcHL0WBkTScv+s/Hy2UqyhO1CQ+vmtBWmnYIAmv2i8tDF+EubT8B0pF/xS\nYqAMQkwrpAg+BBXMXeAGISzVkokPfWdIirF3U8MCm108ukXAa32UzYNzPCSdF4Fw\nMHEGc4fFhevH0QHL5BjuOHx5ZiPIWPQHnEphdR241oTFFyN2Gb4XSO9zi3GBp2qW\nGuw/t5xZgp/JiaZVhFcc2TCIxY1kPCdFF/58jfakSOgBr8hPyfthUboSd/bVn+AB\nVRuEcJbHCpIiEdM9f28ks/cCqGeOMnAKWIaRTKtlOtrjl08om1m3cZKXzmX/Ewg9\nuL4qMqPu4qMFk71sFzOsPem3A6ECAiTO666gnPHkjZP4hkj1iwK4q8aQrdCo/QRK\nk4TzKvCMpMW6b2U3/YLZAU3siZFIODLRp5ZLgnzcFgVZxF+4vhltaIfaz/NBOJdL\nIR3rMJBeSlPnGXNVWIe6JEAWJ96t3AyHqFGI/GQjqIgkgS4dwyV4o2xvbrUsCS3H\n472gZsfZBQGGDNm8Fjhe3aNaQXZXlVOln7Xn8x4HgmVMeveiNciyFlEU/2oBH0lC\nCWUAuWFW474qvgLp6nUtB/OtWARy