ns","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xl-openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xl-openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xl-openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xl-openai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f2b725102b26185f179c7ccec5fba00f6b01f0a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/f2b725102b26185f179c7ccec5fba00f6b01f0a3","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/f2b725102b26185f179c7ccec5fba00f6b01f0a3"}]},{"sha":"f2b725102b26185f179c7ccec5fba00f6b01f0a3","node_id":"C_kwDOOYsS4doAKGYyYjcyNTEwMmIyNjE4NWYxNzljN2NjZWM1ZmJhMDBmNmIwMWYwYTM","commit":{"author":{"name":"xl-openai","email":"xl@openai.com","date":"2026-06-02T05:10:52Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-02T05:10:52Z"},"message":"[codex] Cache remote plugin catalog for suggestions (#25457)\n\n## Summary\n- cache the global remote plugin catalog when remote plugin listing runs\nand warm it during startup\n- use the cached remote catalog in plugin install recommendations with\ncanonical `plugin@openai-curated-remote` ids\n- reuse the session `PluginsManager` for plugin recommendations so\nremote cache state is visible on the recommend path\n- skip core installed-state verification for remote plugin install\nsuggestions while leaving local plugin and connector verification\nunchanged\n\n## Testing\n- `just fmt`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `cargo test -p codex-core\nlist_tool_suggest_discoverable_plugins_includes_cached_remote_global_plugins`\n- `cargo test -p codex-core\nremote_plugin_install_suggestions_skip_core_installed_verification`\n- `cargo test -p codex-app-server\nplugin_list_includes_remote_marketplaces_when_remote_plugin_enabled`\n\nEarlier focused checks during the same branch: codex-tools TUI filter\ntest, request_plugin_install tests, and codex-app-server build.","tree":{"sha":"0b4d5c062820946481ca4363e6fe48163c8f059e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/0b4d5c062820946481ca4363e6fe48163c8f059e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/f2b725102b26185f179c7ccec5fba00f6b01f0a3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHmXcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQtkQAKSM0zB7yNjOw8w1839D24UG\nNO9AWoiTXNs1Sc9XjgKVLpNLVPuVmqMoefn8Vz/UEvqz1DSDMgOteF25YRt7OoD5\nK5IY3fp65F/UlrRiQWAdcQG34fWFiYOiq/SGaxiRuSMzp7RMxZPoZMDOcO3ylDjc\nAroy7N3/ohWxdaVJI3uU91WfhLkd3E5xAOXqb8xmSQYiVgWKs8L5d/i4FhoCa/bS\nXZcte5iQBgWNTSLbq++OAcMvnYYS7vudV8jFL8z6a7kuWDWHowa6x49hlz5j/zUu\n0QiX+NBWja0k/FWJnH0S59L02AynOkhh+IVaJbpYiWLLCNc6KzxxunXIOsykTEsg\nvs5J56xOREs9AAg8iYL8jFxjHucywiVOPLmnuvKhtv8EhyqemwlBWDZrnaEZdOCm\no3mhw8qES1kq95IP5HFSUvz2ucfnFZT6J8+1NEZr+WkwFfHnPayjGn6JLPoW8iqp\nKt08EGYowTGDnA0CkUuwYnbkgy/JSAPOX3+iUT2DEp2T25HrBGyZOMu5ZtB1wCO1\nDEJ2DdJ89NAdq+qFvE3F8CpV3/IYF+NqABkGfwOGKbgtZueTYK2LJHhXY1tYrXyz\ntVEO42aPzyUdu0+fI/Yg9VtBbx/uk2TQebRjrmyQE8wJUtK8Tqb1UzKOiVzR4Fzj\n0MtXz3RCB6WSYk75jtKK\n=3My0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 0b4d5c062820946481ca4363e6fe48163c8f059e\nparent cb63ee7f5d077a625fe93d292bbcf5a4b9dfc6a3\nauthor xl-openai <xl@openai.com> 1780377052 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780377052 -0700\n\n[codex] Cache remote plugin catalog for suggestions (#25457)\n\n## Summary\n- cache the global remote plugin catalog when remote plugin listing runs\nand warm it during startup\n- use the cached remote catalog in plugin install recommendations with\ncanonical `plugin@openai-curated-remote` ids\n- reuse the session `PluginsManager` for plugin recommendations so\nremote cache state is visible on the recommend path\n- skip core installed-state verification for remote plugin install\nsuggestions while leaving local plugin and connector verification\nunchanged\n\n## Testing\n- `just fmt`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `cargo test -p codex-core\nlist_tool_suggest_discoverable_plugins_includes_cached_remote_global_plugins`\n- `cargo test -p codex-core\nremote_plugin_install_suggestions_skip_core_installed_verification`\n- `cargo test -p codex-app-server\nplugin_list_includes_remote_marketplaces_when_remote_plugin_enabled`\n\nEarlier focused checks during the same branch: codex-tools TUI filter\ntest, request_plugin_install tests, and codex-app-server build.","verified_at":"2026-06-02T05:10:52Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/f2b725102b26185f179c7ccec5fba00f6b01f0a3","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/f2b725102b26185f179c7ccec5fba00f6b01f0a3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/f2b725102b26185f179c7ccec5fba00f6b01f0a3/comments","author":{"login":"xl-openai","id":184293535,"node_id":"U_kgDOCvwYnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184293535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xl-openai","html_url":"https://github.com/xl-openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com